# Trading app architecture

- **Pipeline:** Ingest (news + price + conditions) → Enrich (sentiment, asset tags) → Analysis (aggregate report) → Recommendations (≤5/day, risk_tier) → Output.
- **Phase 2 behaviour (PLAN_MODE):** One batch per day; max 5 recommendations; update job only refreshes **active trades** (Took it); Skipped recs get no updates.
- Prefer storing raw inputs and derived insight separately so you can recompute or backtest.
